{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What this Demo provides :</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Stages of Hell Rod</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Different Enemy Types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Playable Main Character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Unique Bullet Types\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Introduction:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Possess a Demon, Stop the Angel Forces.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your death comes as the Combo Meter depletes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fall.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There will always be more Angels to kill.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000130/extras/91f8245c482e100e0cc2ab4f5a15423d.poster.avif?t=1757713536\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000130/extras/91f8245c482e100e0cc2ab4f5a15423d.webm?t=1757713536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000130/extras/91f8245c482e100e0cc2ab4f5a15423d.mp4?t=1757713536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a geek devil. You've received a possession file that can access and take control of the nervous system of an Automatic Infernal Defense Unit (<strong>AIDU</strong>). For <strong>AIDU</strong>, the only way to survive is to absorb the soul essence from the Angel Forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double Jump, Slide, Back Slide, Slam, Dash, Dash Jump,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, Charge Shoot, Reload Parry, Counter,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>AND KILL.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain your movesets, land your bullets, and <strong>Fall</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra Fast Paced, Character-Action, Free-Fall Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever-Changing Vertical Levels without any loading screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various Upgrades for your Gun and Character.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000130?t=1757713536","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000130?t=1757713536","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000130/e52f00c95bdc6198691018f36c5c60982ff304a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757713536","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000130/e52f00c95bdc6198691018f36c5c60982ff304a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757713536","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What this Demo provides :</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Stages of Hell Rod</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Different Enemy Types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Playable Main Character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Unique Bullet Types\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Introduction:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Possess a Demon, Stop the Angel Forces.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your death comes as the Combo Meter depletes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fall.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There will always be more Angels to kill.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vide